Kayo Yin and Jacob Steinhardt.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">Which attention heads matter for in-context learning?

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">In <em id="bib.bib45.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Forty-second International Conference on Machine Learning</em>, 2025.

