<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 9: </span>nDCG@10 on DBPedia top-40 with CoRe-R for Granite-3.2 8B. All attention heads within Granite-3.2 8B are equally important for re-ranking tasks.</figcaption>
